{"id": "1791460", "name": "האם הפונקציה הנתונה היא חח\"ע והאם מונוטונית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f1", "params": ["x"], "body": "m1 * x + y1 - m1*x1"}, {"name": "f3", "params": ["x"], "body": "m3 * x + y3 - m3*x3"}, {"name": "f2", "params": ["x"], "body": "m2 * x + yy2 - m2*x2"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3_VISUAL_FIX_V10\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 4px;\">חד־חד־ערכיות ומונוטוניות של פונקציה מקוטעת</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #665f6b;\">שני הסעיפים נבדקים בנפרד</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 12px;\">הפונקציה הנתונה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(140px,1fr) minmax(210px,1.5fr); gap: 8px 18px; align-items: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:0}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:3}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:2}},{{CT:4}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:5}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:4}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">א. האם הפונקציה חד־חד־ערכית?</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 7px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">ב. האם הפונקציה מונוטונית לא־יורדת?</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 7px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3_VISUAL_FIX_V10\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px;\">\n<p><strong>מונוטוניות:</strong> יש לבדוק את ההתנהגות בכל קטע וגם את המעבר בין הקטעים. עבור הנתונים שנוצרו כאן התשובה היא <strong>{{CT:7}}</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>חד־חד־ערכיות:</strong> צריך לוודא שאין שני ערכי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\displaystyle x \\)</span> שונים שמקבלים אותו ערך פונקציה. עבור הנתונים שנוצרו כאן התשובה היא <strong>{{CT:8}}</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה. יפה מאוד.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">תשובתך נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "injective", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "monotone", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["LL", "injective", "m1", "m2", "m3", "monotone", "x0", "x1", "x2", "x3", "y0", "y1", "y2", "y3", "yy1", "yy2"], "nvariants": 50}